  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att finansiera en workshop f&#xf6;r att samla partners och akt&#xf6;rer inom    gr&#xe4;ns&#xf6;verskridande vattensamarbete i MENA regionen under              IWA-konferensen i Amman, 18-22 okt 2015 samt att finansiera           nationella deltagare fr&#xe5;n SoW-VU.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing of a workshop during the IWA-conference in order to gather  partners to evaluate and improve regional transboundary water         managmeent. Amman, 18-22 Oct 2015. The participation of a number of   national partners from Sow-VU will also be financed.</narrative>
